{"unit_id": "ai-eks__dsh-auth-tunnel#card-zh", "repo": "ai-eks/dsh-auth-tunnel", "commit": "8ce6300b09c4aa2fecbbdd6efed85e99a4492200", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-auth-tunnel（DSH Web 插件）：为 Web 界面提供 Cloudflare Tunnel 公网访问。它在本机服务前启动回环密码门，并由 cloudflared 建立临时或命名隧道。提供密码登录、HTTP/WebSocket 代理、Web 设置卡和公网 URL。需要共享密码与 cloudflared；命名模式还需 Tunnel Token、主机名和固定端口。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["src/index.ts:31-66", "src/index.ts:1168-1214", "src/client/index.tsx:875-916", "cordis.patch.yml:15-21"]}
